Fix: split on whitespace AND punctuation. Recognized as `#` followed by one or more
 alphanumerics/`-`/`_`. A general fix that preserves ordering: iterate through all
 maximal runs matching `#[0-9A-Za-z_-]+` via regex and collect in order of appearance
. This handles:
